{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>渣打藝趣嘉年華「壓軸巡遊」今日（15日）下午在銅鑼灣舉行，大批市民圍觀。本文短片帶讀者現場一睹不同巨型木偶和表演者的風采，感受銅鑼灣鬧市變身流動童話世界的氛圍。（拍攝及剪接：歐蕙瑩）</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T10:18:58.130346+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":91,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T09:57:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T10:12:56.285034+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T10:12:56.285034+00:00","content_hash":"99cd7b4d191a5f9ff122aa4895903c1b009a43c6d7948ebd00af025e1cdc7972","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}